/// known-gap: interp has no concurrency builtins (VM only, spec 2026-10-08)
/// What tasks print appears in input order, after the swarm finishes.
act shout(x)
    i | 0
    while i < (5 - x) * 500
        i |= i + 1
    xx
    say("task {x}")
    return x
xx
r | :swarm([1, 2, 3, 4], shout, 4)
say(r)
